    "title": "Regulatory Roles of Boreal and Nemoral Forests in the Volga River Basin in Carbon Cycle and Anthropogenic Warming Mitigation: A Predictive Empirical-Statistical Modeling Study",
    "venue": {
        "name": "Resources Environment and Information Engineering",
